#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/automated_actions.rst:442
msgid ""
"If the new or duplicated record is being created on another model, select a "
"field in the :guilabel:`Link Field` field to link the record that triggered "
"the creation of the new or duplicated record."
msgstr ""
"إذا كان السجل الجديد أو المكرر يتم إنشاؤه على نموذج آخر، حدد حقلاً في "
"حقل :guilabel:`حقل الربط` لربط السجل الذي أدى إلى إنشاء السجل الجديد أو "
"المكرر."

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/automated_actions.rst:447
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Link Field` dropdown menu only contains :ref:`one2many fields "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields-one2many>` existing on the current model "
"that are linked to a :ref:`many2one field <studio/fields/relational-fields-"
"many2one>` on the target model."
msgstr ""
"قائمة :guilabel:`حقل الربط` المنسدلة تحتوي فقط على :ref:`حقول واحد لمتعدد "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields-one2many>` الموجودة على النموذج الحالي "
"والمرتبطة بـ :ref:`حقل متعدد لواحد <studio/fields/relational-fields-"
"many2one>` على النموذج المستهدف."

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/automated_actions.rst:452
msgid ""
"To configure an automation rule to duplicate a project, e.g. a project "
