msgstr "الشركة"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/models_modules_apps.rst:162
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Company` adds to the :ref:`studio/views/general/form` "
"and :ref:`studio/views/multiple-records/list` views a :ref:`Many2One field "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields-many2one>` linked to the *Company* model."
msgstr ""
"يؤدي تحديد :guilabel:`الشركة` إلى إضافة :ref:`حقل متعدد لواحد <studio/fields/"
"relational-fields-many2one>` مرتبط بنموذج *الشركة* إلى عروض :ref:`studio/"
"views/general/form` و:ref:`studio/views/multiple-records/list`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/models_modules_apps.rst:167
